OL,3,GNEWSAConcern around airport parking
OL,4,Achanges and signs
OL,5,
OL,6,FIslanders have raised concerns about
OL,7,FJersey airport's new parking layout,
OL,8,Fquestioning the visibility of signs and
OL,9,Fthe transparency of charges.
OL,11,FOne driver was unexpectedly charged
OL,12,F#36.38 for a 12-minute stay while
OL,13,Fanother described having difficulties
OL,14,Freading the "menu" of parking options
OL,15,Ffrom his vehicle.
OL,17,FAnother said he was worried the overall
OL,18,Fchanges, including an overhaul of the
OL,19,Fdepartures area, were "destroying the
OL,20,Funique character of the island".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
