OL,3,GNEWSAConcern around airport parking
OL,4,Achanges and signs
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn response Ports of Jersey said it
OL,7,Fwould "review the signage to ensure it
OL,8,Fmeets customer expectations," and
OL,9,Fdeputy Samantha Gleave said the
OL,10,Fmodernisation of the airport would
OL,11,Fbenefit the island as a whole.
